subnetting:

increment is the range we get for each bit turned on in the subnet mask:

1000 0000 → 128
1100 0000 → 64
1110 0000 → 32
1111 0000 → 16
1111 1000 → 8
1111 1100 → 4
1111 1110 → 2
1111 1111 → 1


